 for numerical data from right to left in the lines. Different line item formats require consideration of diverse layouts.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"EndLine":"45","Path":"\"/Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/index.html\"","StartLine":"1"}}]}
